"|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n"
"| Piccola scala | $^{20}\\mathrm{Ne}$ (2p + 2n) | $sd$ | 24 | 640 | Sì |\n"
"| Grande scala | $^{44}\\mathrm{Ti}$ (2p + 2n) | $pf$ | 40 | 4.000 | Sì |\n"
"| Grande scala | $^{48}\\mathrm{Cr}$ (4p + 4n) | $pf$ | 40 | 1.963.461 | No |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The small-scale run is the walkthrough. Both large-scale runs use a 40-qubit register: the first is\n"
